== Effects ==
* Adds a chance to shoot a tooth instead of a tear, which deals ×3.2 Isaac's [[damage]].

== Notes ==
* The chance to fire a tooth depends on the [[luck]] stat, and the formula used to determine the chance is: <math>\frac1 { 10 - \left \lfloor \mathit{Luck}  \right \rfloor}</math><ref>[https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/15K8Xgxoxdx68AIaxuLXgZoJJlG36UPgy3_aeDpAM5tU/edit?usp=sharing|The Binding of Isaac Item Trigger Testing]</ref>
** At base luck (0), the chance is 10%, maxing out at 100% at 9 luck.
* This trinket is identical in function to {{i|Tough Love}}, so all interactions with that item apply to this trinket as well.

== Interactions ==
* {{A|Golden Trinket|r+}} / {{i|Mom's Box|r+}}: At base luck, having either increases the chance to 20% and having both to 33%.
* {{i|Tough Love}}: Activation rates are individually applied to each tear, effectively allowing for higher amounts of teeth.

== Trivia ==
* [[anti:Jawbreaker|Jawbreaker]] originates from the ''Antibirth'' mod, and by extension, from the ''Community Remix'' mod for the flash version.
** In ''Community Remix'', it was named ''The Jaw Breaker''.<ref>https://web.archive.org/web/20221115035837/http://platinumgod.co.uk/old/index.html</ref>

